{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-15","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a cube number measure a cube number, the side will also measure the side; and, if the side measure the side, the cube will also measure the cube.","book":8,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","contentId":"euclid-8-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f97d4dade0af4aa6999091428060a071a070745a805c3e01709ec0873e1b62a1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-15.statement","euclid-8-15.construction.1","euclid-8-15.construction.2","euclid-8-15.proof.1","euclid-8-15.proof.2","euclid-8-15.proof.3","euclid-8-15.proof.4","euclid-8-15.proof.5","euclid-8-15.conclusion","euclid-8-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf297cddc426ff0a7d68d21e135a129b2d7a1f38110207949d8a814eef0f685d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cube number measure a cube number, the side will also measure the side; and, if the side measure the side, the cube will also measure the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果是立方数 整除 a 立方数, 一方也会是整除; 如果是整除, 方块也会是整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2dba2ef70c9574d0fa4a04b83474262b334d1bc85f8d89a8e3bae1b26ae07b11","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cube number A measure the cube B, and let C be the side of A and D of B; I say that C measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A B 立方体B C 和B A 和D 的边;我说是 C 整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f367df5af8f064e4d69702d71e62b0df467ba4762af7f40069a7f49beefa66ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C by multiplying itself make E, and let D by multiplying itself make G; further, let C by multiplying D make F, and let C, D by multiplying F make H, K respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让C乘以乘以E乘以乘以D,即为G;进一步将C和D的产品改为F、C,D乘以F 分别是H,K"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"216b2058739dddf8a4f720983b9f7c5e5e48d88248647de71df38b4159145ec6","citations":["euclid-8-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now it is manifest that E, F, G and A, H, K, B are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to D. [[VIII. 11, 12](/principles/euclid-8-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,E、F、G和A、H、K、B继续为成比例,比例为C至D。 [[VIII. 11, 12](/principles/euclid-8-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"554e4315dfdac8ac7593ef6c5b76dd240d112d000c92ebc30e04305b0eae145c","citations":["euclid-8-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, H, K, B are continuously proportional, and A measures B, therefore it also measures H. [[VIII. 7](/principles/euclid-8-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自A起,H,K,B是连续成比例和A 整除 B项索赔因此,它也是整除 H。 [[VIII. 7](/principles/euclid-8-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ebda840383267d993eddc03aacb287849ac51189e569676dd9a801f06d3d6a7","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as A is to H, so is C to D; therefore C also measures D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比H等于C比D,因此C也等于整除、D；A 与 H 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62d69a67616a22944e023f768729d4bd1f4ac36fb871d9d2b37c37f7a23eb9b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let C measure D; I say that A will also measure B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让我们来讨论C 整除 D;我说A也将讨论整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10a9c8f32a89f1d38c06bd1ecbf2dde2751298daa76ab5aeca115035f8f6c9d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can prove in a similar manner that A, H, K, B are continuously proportional in the ratio of C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑工程,我们同样可以证明,A、H、K、B持续为成比例,比例为C至D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"967440e92aafc4802e867096a3fb9e302e495bc269de1552c137025cbf2e839f","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since C measures D, and, as C is to D, so is A to H, therefore A also measures H, [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] so that A measures B also. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C 整除 D,C比D等于A比H,A比整除,H,A比A,A比C,A比C,C比B；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 H 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-15.source","contentId":"euclid-8-15","revisionId":"euclid-8-15@raw-f97d4dade0af4aa6","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ca430efade59a0d48315ea967a955054bf2cb6b47fd0d554e704d896782fadf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93